# Daily News

Separate module — not vocab SM-2 / Simple flashcards.

## Data

- Collection `news_digests`: one doc per VN calendar day (`YYYY-MM-DD`, UTC+7)
- Fields: `status` (`building`|`ready`|`failed`), `built_at`, `domestic[]`, `world[]`, `source`, `error?`
- Item shape: `{ title, url, summary, published_at? }`
- Unique index on `date` via `create_indexes`

## Pipeline

- RSS: `vnexpress.net/rss/thoi-su.rss` (domestic), `the-gioi.rss` (world); top 5 each
- Summarize with OpenRouter (`OPENROUTER_MODEL_NEWS` → else HINT → `openrouter/free`)
- Lazy build on `GET /news/today`; Mongo lock avoids stampede; `POST /news/refresh` force (1/hour)

## API / FE

- Auth JWT; router `api_news.py` mounted in `main.py`
- FE `/news` + nav **News**; `useApi()` with long timeout for first build of the day
- Always link to original VnExpress URL; attribution “Nguồn: VnExpress”
